WEBVTT - Video-Compression Drag & Drop Demonstration

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Dragging and dropping a high-bitrate video file onto the target preset executable.

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
Automated video analysis initiates: probing duration, frame rate, resolution, and audio stream.

00:07.000 --> 00:12.000
Hardware encoder detection selects the fastest available GPU encoder with automatic fallback.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Smart split point analysis divides workload into keyframe-aligned segments for parallel processing.

00:18.000 --> 00:25.000
Dual-worker Rich TUI displays real-time progress, encoding FPS, bitrate, and time remaining.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Lossless concatenation stitches segments with faststart progressive streaming flags.
